    {
      "bbox": [
        299,
        128,
        920,
        251
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City Council has passed and is Mayor, have approved a local law designated as Local Law No. 3 of 1968 which amends the New York City Charter by providing for the consolidation of the Department of Sanitation, the Department of Water Supply, Gas and Electricity (except for the Bureau of Gas and Electricity), the Department of Air Pollution Control and the Bureau of Water Pollution Control of the Department of Public Works into an Environmental Protection Administration and prescribes the functions, powers and duties of such administration and agencies; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.284,
          "min": -1.3008
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 110,
          "mean": -0.0382,
          "min": -0.4901
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 156,
        "area_px": 78375,
        "density": 0.00199,
        "chars": 574,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 3679.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        361,
        937,
        394
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Such local law provides by its terms that it shall take effect on such date as I shall provide by executive order, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.2411,
          "min": -1.1583
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0008
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0157,
          "min": -0.2818
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 72,
        "area_px": 21114,
        "density": 0.00341,
        "chars": 127,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 1763.89
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        391,
        937,
        423
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Implementation of such local law requires the creation of an organizational structure to fund the Environmental Protection Administration's responsibilities; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.2079,
          "min": -1.0275
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.009,
          "min": -0.092
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 78,
        "area_px": 20493,
        "density": 0.00381,
        "chars": 170,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2179.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        421,
        937,
        481
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Implementation of such local law and development of programs to enhance the environment of the City of New York requires coordination of the operations of other agencies of the City government with the operation of the Environmental Protection Administration; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.1505,
          "min": -1.0504
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 44,
          "mean": -0.0116,
          "min": -0.4787
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 61,
        "area_px": 38502,
        "density": 0.00158,
        "chars": 272,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 4459.02
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        479,
        937,
        527
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Establishment of effective liaison with the Federal and State governments is desirable to enhance eligibility for and use of Federal and State programs of financial aid.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.1731,
          "min": -1.3139
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0356,
          "min": -0.5426
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28,
        "area_px": 30429,
        "density": 0.00092,
        "chars": 178,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 6357.14
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        525,
        937,
        557
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now therefore, by the power vested in me as the Mayor of The City of New York, I hereby order as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.1673,
          "min": -1.0608
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.0175,
          "min": -0.1436
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16,
        "area_px": 20493,
        "density": 0.00078,
        "chars": 105,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 6562.5
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        352,
        554,
        933,
        571
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The effective date of Local Law No. 3 of 1968 shall be March 15, 1968.",
      "logprob_stats": {
