      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a72 The Environmental Protection Administrator shall, in his discretion, organize the administration into departments, bureaus, boards, divisions or offices, and make assignments of powers and duties among them and from time to time change such organization or assignments subject only to the extent to which the organization is prescribed by law.",
      "logprob_stats": {
